Yes, like Paul
already mentioned,

00:43:52.760 --> 00:43:55.640
now with the GDPR
coming next year,

00:43:55.640 --> 00:43:59.460
we certainly need to be aware
of what's in our database,

00:43:59.460 --> 00:44:04.730
if it's sensitive data, our
personal data in our datasets.

00:44:04.730 --> 00:44:07.670
As a developer, I'm
always worried about that,

00:44:07.670 --> 00:44:13.070
so luckily, we now have the DLP
API, data loss prevention API,

00:44:13.070 --> 00:44:14.670
