00:44:40.680 --> 00:44:42.990
the data that is sensitive.

00:44:42.990 --> 00:44:44.090
And you can even flag it.

00:44:44.090 --> 00:44:45.770
You can even mask it.

00:44:45.770 --> 00:44:48.320
To show that, I'd like
